Dual‑axis fortress

A defensive spine running Gatehouse → Battlement → Great Hall → 
Chapel, and a domestic spine running Kitchen → Guardroom → Guest 
Chambers → Upper Chapel → Solar. The courtyard acts as the global 
mixing node.

